{"ts":"2026-08-30T11:02:26.273Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"f237494c9fe27db071e2f599","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-edywqn","lineage:pm-edywqn","lineage:pm-5k4v","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-edywqn","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-edywqn","lineage:pm-edywqn","lineage:pm-5k4v","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.251","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-30T11:02:26.273Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-30T11:02:26.273Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Partial remediation landed with this report: the gate's size verdicts now carry a bounded excerpt of the observed output, so the failure text names the rows that grew instead of only the number that grew. That is what turned this from an unexplained red gate into a diagnosis in one run, and it is the fourth acceptance criterion. The excerpt is held in memory on the measurement record only; budgetForMeasurement selects named fields, so nothing is persisted into scripts/release/token-budgets.json.\n\nThe remaining criteria are untouched and are the substance of this item: closing the fixture environment by allowlist, and actually running the workstation-versus-runner equivalence control that pm-t7wn04 specified and did not deliver.\n\nDeliberately not done: regenerating the baseline with --update. On this workstation that would write harness-dependent rows into the committed manifest and turn hosted CI red, which is the exact inversion of the current failure and would make the gate agree with the workstation instead of making it independent of both."}]}],"before_hash":"2f73e7d3d74b5390c578f5cf2bd799f6bc1e300e2d1d10db30776c47a8c3cee5","after_hash":"7303791a918f7ab1414639d9cfe99d8bd5ccd332f753ae15c4c89fa5019ec07e","item_hash_version":3}
